  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Sejian",
      "content": "I am... disappointed by the ending.\r\n\r\n**SPOILERS AHEAD:**\r\n\r\n\"I AM YOUR MOTHER!\"\r\n\r\nDo you get that reference?\r\n\r\nIt's from a movie. A horror movie similar to this one.\r\n\r\nThis movie is fine. I was just kinda hoping for a supernatural crow-witch showdown, and I am disappointed that we did not get it. Also, Bette is the grand-daughter. Unless I'm mistaken, that fact is never established until the very end of the movie. I assume we're meant to believe that the grand-mother's mental state is responsible for the twisted version of reality we see throughout the movie.\r\n\r\nThis movie is fine. I was just kinda hoping for a supernatural crow-witch showdown, and I am disappointed that we did not get it. The more I say it, the less disappointed I will be.",
      "rating": 6,
      "createdAt": "2026-01-28T04:02:25Z"
    }
